rove the same to the others then we see  akshay and wadia walking down the  hallway akshay reveals that he was the  one who sent the janitor to sell atish  the fake question papers he hopes that  wadia will be proud of him but instead  he looks at him in disappointment in the  morning assembly the students are  nervous about being expelled but to  their surprise wadia apologizes for not  believing in class 9f and claims that he  sent the janitor with the fake question  paper he wants to save his student as  nina did for 9f in the end the students  are brought to the stage and two of them  are given the prefect badges a year  later the school takes part in the  national science fair competition the  students collectively take part in it  and win the first prize  cut to 25 years later nina is now the  principal of the school it is her last  day as a teacher before retiring when  she walks out she meets the former 9f  members who have all grown into  successful adults the movie ends as they  reunite subscribe for more videos like  this turn on notifications and leave a  like to help the channel out thank you  for watching

